              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Lola, ndapiga ngumi fumba rangu kpwa kukala nkatsukirirwa yo fwaida isiyo ya haki na ko kuolagana kahi yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dze, mioyo yenu indaweza kuvumirira na mikono yenu kpwenderera kukala na nguvu ndiphokushuulikirani? Mimi Mwenyezi Mlungu nkaamba, nami nindavihenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindakutsamulani kahi za mataifa ganjina na kahi za tsi mbali-mbali, na nyo unajisi wenu nindaukomesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namwi mndiphokala najisi kuno atu a mataifa analola, mundamanya kukala mimi, ndimi Mwenyezi Mlungu.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu wagomba nami achiamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwanadamu, atu a Iziraeli kpwangu akakala uchafu, osi ni shaba, bamba, chuma na aina ya chuma chiihwacho risasi yorichwa kpwenye nyungu dzulu ya moho munji, aho akala uchafu wa feza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba hivi: ‘Kpwa sababu mosi mukakala uchafu wa feza, lola mosi ndakukusanyani Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dza mutu akusanyavyo mawe garigo na feza, shaba, chuma, risasi na bamba akagatiya nyunguni dzulu ya jimbijimbi ra moho ili garurumuswe, ndivyo mimi ndivyokukusanyani kpwa tsukizi nikutiyeni mo mudzini muyayuke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindakukusanyani na nikuasireni moho wa tsukizi zangu, namwi mundayayuka mo mudzini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dza feza iyayuswavyo kpwenye nyungu dzulu ya moho munji, mwimwi mundayayuka mo mudzini, namwi mundamanya kukala mimi Mwenyezi Mlungu nikakutsukirirwani sana.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
